    "response": "TAP XVI economic democracy reform (response toward crony capitalism criticisms). Kesimpulannya: Krisis ekonomi 1997-1998 adalah exogenous shock yang broke the institutional equilibrium yang Suharto had maintained. Without crisis, Orde Baru likely would have continued—Suharto might have sought sixth term dalam 1998 (previous patterns suggest he would renominate himself). Krisis made that continuation impossible: economy collapse + social explosion + military fracture = only viable path forward adalah 'controlled transition' dengan Habibie as compromise candidate. TAP 1998 adalah institutional codification dari this forced transition, embedding reforms yang Habibie felt pressured untuk implement. Tanpa krisis ekonomi, tidak ada Reformasi 1998."
